<p>All images on AI Headline Hub are AI-generated illustrations. They are illustrative only: they are not photographs of real people, places or events, and they were not taken at any event we report on.</p>
<p>Each image carries a "Source" link underneath that leads to this page.</p>
<p>Questions about an image? Use the <a href="/contact/">contact page</a>.</p>
